<title>SWEDEN: H&amp;M says sales still stong in firmer market.</title>
<headline>H&amp;M says sales still stong in firmer market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail group Hennes &amp; Mauritz (H&amp;M) on Friday said its sales continued strong, outperforming an improved market trend across Europe.</p>
</text>
